        },
        {
          "text": "There was not another soul in sight",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 815
        },
        {
          "text": "Ting",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 563
        },
        {
          "text": "There was the noise again",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 858
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Tables draped with taffeta, harvest foliage, and melting wax candles. A bonfire celebration, with eccentric characters d",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2398
        }
      ],
      "words": 28
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "With my fingers, I picked at it. What I pulled off my face was not sweat at all",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3304
        },
        {
          "text": "An irregularly cut diamond, small as my fingernail, pinched between my fingers",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3385
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They looked like a perfect portrait of how I wanted to remember them. Happy, peaceful",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6109
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I knew this was goodbye for my father. We had all anticipated it for a while",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6574
        },
        {
          "text": "What I hadn’t prepared for was saying goodbye to them both",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6652
        }
      ],
      "words": 28
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It wasn’t what I wanted, but it was what they needed",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6765
        },
        {
          "text": "They were together, and that was enough",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6922
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A golden mask with wings by the ears, bronzy hands covering the eyes, with a patronly halo above",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9544
        },
        {
          "text": "Behind him, six more wings, a horaltic pose as they postured themselves out",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9889
        }
      ],
      "words": 32
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Will you not look at me, sweet Iris?” he pleaded",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10742
        },
        {
          "text": "“Will you see me, Beast?” I finally looked at him",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10895
        },
        {
          "text": "“I do,” he said",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11078
        }
      ],
      "words": 26
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I can’t stay with you,” I said",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12717
        },
        {
          "text": "“What is there for you in that world that I can’t give you?” he asked",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12835
        },
        {
          "text": "“Humanity,” I said",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12943
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You”—he brushed the hair from my face, an attempt at comfort before those next treacherous words—“were supposed to take",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13393
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I am a pet to you, a project.” I laughed. “You made me to imprison me, in the same fate you so despised.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14989
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He’d always intended for me to go, but he needed me willing",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16699
        },
        {
          "text": "“You were going to convince me to die anyway, because that’s what you need, right?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16759
        }
      ],
      "words": 28
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Goodbye, Altair,” I said with a smile. “You were a life of lessons.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18233
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I whispered against his lips",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18299
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obscuria.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18334
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句14",
      "no": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I was in a box",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19248
        },
        {
          "text": "A safety casket",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19264
        }
      ],
      "words": 9
    },
    {
      "block": "原句15",
      "no": 15,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "And the ringing would go on for hours before anyone noticed, even longer before the digging would start, and all the whi",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19422
        },
        {
          "text": "Until I heard the undertakers’ shovels knock on my casket door",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19657
        }
      ],
